          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulabona burafu bwe lirima liase bulayi bwene nga ne mubona bumemu bwe kumulilo. Ndamura mu makhono ke babaandu baabi, barafu lukali, baali ne limanya mu bwonaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumulilo kulababunia enywe. Kamafuki kenywe kalachichukha mu sibala sienywe. Se alikhowo oolimukhebulila enywe lundi tawe. Ese Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi nalomile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.32"
            ]
